        "content": "## WF-10 SOS Cancel Handler\n\nCalled by WF-2a when a consented elder sends the whole message CANCEL.\n\nOption A (ruled 17 Aug 2026): status goes to resolved, NOT cancelled - sos_status has only open and resolved. resolved_by_role stays NULL, so WF-4c names the resolver as Someone.\n\nGuarded: a zero-row UPDATE emits success:true, so Resolution Written? gates the broadcast. No open event = a plain reply, not a failure.",
